	(text "The mains-presence inputs MAINS_PRES_C (PE15) and MAINS_PRES_S (PD7) are not drawn: no parts are placed for them. Their controller pins stay free and their header ways (WB_LV10 pins 5 and 6) are reserved by the wall-header sheet."
